### The open core's words in Spanish, as both variants say them; a word
### Spain and Latin America say differently lives in es-ES and es-419.

## The language picker

language = Idioma
language-automatic = Automático
language-offer = Ver en español

## Fallos que cualquier página puede mostrar

error-internal = Error interno
# accept: length: English is a two-word technical label; Spanish has no plain noun for "render" ("renderizado" is jargon to a learner), so it says what failed: showing the page.
error-render = Error al mostrar la página
error-exists = Ya existe

## Hace cuánto pasó algo (listas de mazos, dispositivos, usuarios)

when-just-now = hace un momento
when-minutes-ago = hace { $count } min
when-hours-ago = hace { $count } h
when-days-ago = hace { $count } d

